# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CDN-backed delivery:** Declares ``web-svc-cdn`` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes."
msgstr "**CDN-tagatisega tarne:** Deklaratsioonid ``web-svc-cdn`` ülesvoolu, mis teenindab tegelikke CSS baite."

