msgid "**Every MCP implementation ships a Playwright test.** Each role that gains an MCP surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises its MCP surface (a server role's authenticated endpoint, a client role's configured-server list). No MCP role is considered implemented until its Playwright test is present and green."
msgstr "**Iga MCP rakendus saadab Playwrighti testi.** Iga roll, mis saab MCP pinna, PEAB lisama sobiva Playwrighti spetsifikatsiooni `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` mis kasutab MCP-pinda (serverirolli autenditud lõpp-punkt, kliendirolli seadistatud serveri nimekiri). MCP-rolli ei loeta rakendatuks enne, kui selle Playwrighti test on olemas ja roheline."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every addon ships a Playwright test.** Each addon with a user-facing surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises that addon's behaviour (e.g. an `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` login path, a `wp-discourse` round-trip, an enabled Odoo module's UI entry point). Desktop roles (`desk-*`) drive no web surface a Playwright test could exercise and therefore NEVER ship addon specs — the lint forbids spec files under `desk-*` roles. For every web-facing role there is no per-addon exemption: an addon is considered migrated only once its Playwright spec is present and green. Cross-role integration specs (proving two roles are actually connected) run under a dedicated **integration-pair deploy variant** that co-deploys both partner roles, and are added incrementally as each ✅ pair is wired rather than all upfront."
msgstr "**Iga lisand saadab Playwrighti testi.** Iga kasutaja poole suunatud pinnaga lisand PEAB lisama sobiva Playwrighti spetsifikatsiooni `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` , mis kasutab Addoni käitumist (nt `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` sisselogimiskoht `wp-discourse` edasi-tagasi reis, lubatud Odoo mooduli kasutajaliidese sisenemispunkt). Töölauarollid (`desk-*`) ei sõida ühtegi veebipinda, mida võiks kasutada Playwrighti test ja seetõttu MITTE KUNAGI laeva lisandmoodulite spetsifikatsioone - lint keelab spektfailid allpool `desk-*` rollid. Iga veebisuunalise rolli puhul ei ole eraldi erandit: lisand loetakse migreerunuks alles siis, kui selle Playwrighti spekter on olemas ja roheline. Rollidevahelise integratsiooni spetsifikatsioonid (Kaks rolli on tegelikult seotud) kandideerida **integratsioonipaari kasutuselevõtu variant** mis koondab mõlemad partnerrollid ja lisatakse järk-järgult ✅ Paar on pigem traadiga kui kõik ettepoole."

msgid "**Every application-side integration is a 026 addon.** A consuming role declares a `translate` consumer entry gated on the gateway's service flag and an addon that bridges it. The applications in scope are the ones the architecture names: WordPress, Moodle, Discourse, OpenProject, Nextcloud and Matrix; which of them have an upstream consumer of this API is settled under [Re-opened Decisions](#re-opened-decisions)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The ``role_id``/``secret_id`` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in ``.applied.json``, then ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` re-pins to this run’s values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. ``custom-secret-id`` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers ``500`` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Iga rakendus pöörab AppRole'i.** Theo ``role_id``/``secret_id`` Jooksmine ei ole see, mida jooksev eksemplar hoiab. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` proovib varude paari, langeb tagasi paarile, mis on salvestatud ``.applied.json``, siis ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` Re-pins selle jooksu väärtused ja hävitab vana SecretID. Rekord on kirjutatud viimasena, nii et jooks, mis sureb osaliselt, jätab eelmise põlvkonna puutumata. ``custom-secret-id`` on **ei** idempotent – salajaste vastuste ümberkirjutamine ``500`` – seega toimub vahetustehing väärtuse muutumise korral."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The `role_id`/`secret_id` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. `tasks/01_init.yml` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in `.applied.json`, then `tasks/06_rotate.yml` re-pins to this run's values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. `custom-secret-id` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers `500` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Iga rakendus pöörab AppRole'i.** Theo `role_id`/`secret_id` Jooksmine ei ole see, mida jooksev eksemplar hoiab. `tasks/01_init.yml` proovib varude paari, langeb tagasi paarile, mis on salvestatud `.applied.json`, siis `tasks/06_rotate.yml` Taastab selle jooksu väärtused ja hävitab vana SecretID. Rekord on kirjutatud viimasena, nii et jooks, mis sureb osaliselt, jätab eelmise põlvkonna puutumata. `custom-secret-id` on **ei** idempotent – salajaste vastuste ümberkirjutamine `500` – seega toimub vahetustehing väärtuse muutumise korral."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every mounted volume is discarded**, not only the backed-up ones. A volume declared `backup: false` claims to be disposable; a drill that spares it never tests the claim. If its service cannot rebuild it, the health gate goes red — that is the finding, not a false alarm. The single exception is the data directory of an engine whose dump is about to be replayed: it carries the database and its role, which the deploy creates and the container does not, so wiping it would leave `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` with nothing to connect to and the drill would fail at itself instead of at a defect."
msgstr "**Iga paigaldatud maht visatakse ära**, mitte ainult tagavaraks. Deklareeritud maht `backup: false` väidab, et see on ühekordselt kasutatav; külvik, mis säästab seda, ei kontrolli kunagi väidet. Kui selle teenus ei suuda seda taastada, läheb tervisevärav punaseks - see on leid, mitte valehäire. Üks erand on mootori andmekataloog, mille prügimäge hakatakse uuesti esitama: see kannab andmebaasi ja selle rolli, mida juurutamine loob ja konteiner ei tee, nii et selle pühkimine jääks `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` millel pole midagi ühendada ja puurimine ebaõnnestuks iseenesest, mitte defektiga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every ref:** Role data, categories, bundles, files and TODO markers for the deployed working tree, any branch, tag or commit of core, and every branch or tag of its forks."
msgstr "**Iga kohtunik:** Kasutatud tööpuu rolliandmed, kategooriad, kimbud, failid ja TODO markerid, südamiku mis tahes oksad, sildid või vaheseinad ning selle kahvlite kõik harud või sildid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every release:** The latest commit is the default, each release tag is selectable and built on demand."
