# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP admin and BOSH:** Expose the ejabberd web admin and BOSH/WebSocket bindings on the role's HTTP port for browser-based interaction."
msgstr "**HTTP admin ja BOSH:** Avage ejabberdi veebiadministraator ja BOSH / WebSocket seosed rolli HTTP-pordis brauseripõhiseks suhtlemiseks."

