msgid "**HTTP clients are rate-limited and banned by their own address.** The vhost sets ``proxy_forwarded_client_address``, so OpenResty sends ``Forwarded: for=$remote_addr`` on every location and replaces any client-supplied value, and Stalwart reads it (``STALWART_HTTP_SETTINGS``: ``clientIpSource: forwarded`` with one trusted hop, ``forwardedHops: 1``)."
