# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Headless Provisioning:** The administrator is seeded from the role's credential and the first-boot wizard is completed over the API, so no manual click-through is required."
msgstr "**Peata reservid:** Administraator külvatakse rolli mandaadist ja esimese käivitamise nõustaja valmib üle API, nii et käsitsi klikkimine ei ole vajalik."

