msgid "**Hiding.** A disabled method is switched off through the app's own setting where one exists, otherwise hidden by role-injected CSS or JavaScript through the role's `javascript` service. Every app keeps a documented break-glass path for its local admin (URL parameter, recovery account, CLI or token)."
