# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Machine identity:** AppRole is configured independently of human login, so services and automation use their own identities and short-lived tokens instead of a shared administrator token."
msgstr "**Masina tunnusandmed:** AppRole on konfigureeritud inimese sisselogimisest sõltumatult, nii et teenused ja automatiseerimine kasutavad jagatud administraatori token'i asemel oma identiteeti ja lühiajalisi tokeneid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Made Snipe-IT admin bootstrap idempotent** and treated known *users_groups* duplicate constraint errors as non-fatal while keeping strict failure handling for other cases"
msgstr "**Made Snipe- IT admin bootstrap idempotent** ravitud *users_groups* dubleerida piiranguvigu kui mittefataalseid, säilitades samal ajal range tõrkekäsitluse muudel juhtudel"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Magento (Adobe Commerce Open Source)** is a powerful, extensible e-commerce platform built with PHP. It supports multi-store setups, advanced catalog management, promotions, checkout flows, and a rich extension ecosystem."
msgstr "**Magento (Adobe Commerce Open Source)** See on võimas, laiendatav e-kaubanduse platvorm, mis on ehitatud PHP-ga. See toetab mitme kaupluse seadistusi, täiustatud kataloogihaldust, tutvustusi, kassade vooge ja rikkalikku laiendusökosüsteemi."

msgid "**Mail to and from onion addresses.** The new *svc-net-tor-smtp* role accepts mail for *.onion* recipients and delivers it over Tor. The applications reach an onion mail provider too: 27 roles now resolve the provider's onion host inside their containers and skip STARTTLS towards it, since no certificate can exist for an onion name and Tor already encrypts the link. GitLab's test suite checks that a password reset mail actually arrives."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Mail-to-ticket:** When ``web-app-email`` is present, the ``helpdesk`` mailbox is auto-provisioned and Zammad polls it to create tickets from incoming mail."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Mail-to-ticket:** When `web-app-email` is present, the `helpdesk` mailbox is auto-provisioned and Zammad polls it to create tickets from incoming mail."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Mailbox seed:** under the ``mailbox`` email policy of ``web-app-keycloak``, ``svc-db-openldap`` installs the timer. Only once the deploy has applied the mailbox layout, which in a deploy with Keycloak happens after Keycloak accepted the realm’s policy, `tasks/mailbox.yml <./tasks/mailbox.yml>`__ writes the root-only ``mailbox.json`` under ``DIR_RBAC_SYNC``; under the ``external`` policy ``svc-db-openldap`` removes it. While it exists, each run without ``--only`` gives every account of the users OU that holds no ``mail`` the address ``<uid>@<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>`` and the class ``infinitoMailboxUser`` before the hooks read the members. An existing ``mail`` value is never changed. The address comes from the ``ldap_mailbox`` module the deploy’s mailbox layout uses. The run binds as ``LDAP.DN.ADMINISTRATOR.DATA``; its password lives in ``mailbox.json``, never in argv, the log, ``config.json``, or the ``RBAC_SYNC_LDAP`` a host hook receives."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Mailbox seed:** under the `mailbox` email policy of `web-app-keycloak`, `svc-db-openldap` installs the timer. Only once the deploy has applied the mailbox layout, which in a deploy with Keycloak happens after Keycloak accepted the realm's policy, [tasks/mailbox.yml](./tasks/mailbox.yml) writes the root-only `mailbox.json` under `DIR_RBAC_SYNC`; under the `external` policy `svc-db-openldap` removes it. While it exists, each run without `--only` gives every account of the users OU that holds no `mail` the address `<uid>@<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>` and the class `infinitoMailboxUser` before the hooks read the members. An existing `mail` value is never changed. The address comes from the `ldap_mailbox` module the deploy's mailbox layout uses. The run binds as `LDAP.DN.ADMINISTRATOR.DATA`; its password lives in `mailbox.json`, never in argv, the log, `config.json`, or the `RBAC_SYNC_LDAP` a host hook receives."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Maintenance & Administration Tools:** Built-in CLI and web-app-based tools to clear caches, manage the database, and monitor application health."
msgstr "**Hooldus- ja haldusvahendid:** Sisseehitatud CLI ja veebirakendustel põhinevad tööriistad vahemälude puhastamiseks, andmebaasi haldamiseks ja rakenduste tervise jälgimiseks."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Maintenance & Cleanup:** Reduced Let’s Encrypt renewal frequency to avoid rate limits, removed deprecated logs and variables, applied broad refactorings, and merged the Matomo autosetup feature."
msgstr "**Hooldus ja puhastamine:** Vähendatud Let's Encrypti uuendamise sagedus, et vältida määrapiiranguid, eemaldatud iganenud logid ja muutujad, rakendatud laiad refaktoringid ja ühendatud Matomo automaatse seadistamise funktsioon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Major Changes**"
msgstr "**Olulised muudatused**"

msgid "**Major versions arrive with the image updates.** MariaDB moves from 12.3 to 13.0 and upgrades its system tables on start. Odoo moves from 19.0 to 20.0 and does not migrate an existing database across major versions on its own, so back up Odoo before you deploy. XWiki moves from 17.10 to 18.8, and the OpenLDAP base from Debian 12 to 13."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manage Inventories Securely** Your inventories for running Infinito.Nexus MUST be managed in a separate repository and secured with tools such as [Ansible Vault](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) 🔒. Sensitive credentials MUST NEVER be stored in plaintext; use a password file to secure these details."
msgstr "**Varude turvaline haldamine** Töötamise inventar Infinito.Nexus Seda tuleb hallata eraldi hoidlas ja kinnitada selliste vahenditega nagu [Ansible Vault](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) 🔒. Tundlikke volitusi EI TOHI KUNAGI salvestada lihttekstina. Nende andmete turvamiseks kasutage paroolifaili."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Managed credentials:** The gateway master key and the admin UI password are generated and kept as role credentials, and the admin UI username is the platform administrator name."
msgstr "**Hallatud volitused:** Värava peavõti ja administraatori kasutajaliidese parool genereeritakse ja säilitatakse rollivolitustena ning administraatori kasutajanimi on platvormi administraatori nimi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager Defaults:** Deploys custom timeouts via ``timeouts.conf``."
msgstr "**Halduri vaikeväärtused:** Kohandatud aegumiste rakendamine ``timeouts.conf``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager Defaults:** Deploys custom timeouts via `timeouts.conf`."
msgstr "**Halduri vaikeväärtused:** Kohandatud aegumiste rakendamine `timeouts.conf`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager-pinned** central on-disk state stays node-local (never on NFS) in swarm."
msgstr "**Mänedžer** keskse ketta oleku püsimine sõlme asukohas (NFS) parvel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manager-pinned, stateful:** Single instance per cluster; bypasses swarm task lifecycle so its volume cannot end up on a worker."
msgstr "**Mänedžer-pind, riikkondsus:** Üks eksemplar klastri kohta; möödub sülemisülesande elutsüklist, nii et selle maht ei jõua töötajale."

msgid "**Mandatory keys:** Without the block the role converges no deploy project and registers no deploy app. Once the block is present, ``repository.url``, ``repository.branch``, ``repository.key`` and ``vault_password`` are all mandatory and none has a default, so a deploy with one of them missing fails."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Mandatory keys:** Without the block the role converges no deploy project and registers no deploy app. Once the block is present, `repository.url`, `repository.branch`, `repository.key` and `vault_password` are all mandatory and none has a default, so a deploy with one of them missing fails."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Manual Update and Log Access**: Provides guidance for viewing logs, accessing containers, and performing manual updates."
msgstr "**Käsitsi uuendamine ja logijuurdepääs**Annab juhiseid logide vaatamiseks, konteineritele juurdepääsuks ja käsitsi uuendamiseks."

