msgid "**Palette engine.** An in-repo OKLCH lookup plugin replaces the `colorscheme_generator` dependency. Its only input is `design.colors.base`. It derives a primary scale 50 to 950, tinted neutrals, status colors (success, warning, danger, info) with fixed hues and harmonised chroma, on-colors chosen by contrast, and a dedicated dark palette (no lightness inversion). Text tokens meet WCAG 2.2 AA (4.5:1), UI and large text meet 3:1, body text meets AAA (7:1). An invalid hex value fails the deploy."
