msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` or `/roles/web-app-kix/user` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. On every sign-in `GroupDNBasedRoleSync` sets the KIX roles from the role groups: `administrator` grants `Superuser`, `user` grants `Ticket Agent`, and a role the user no longer holds is revoked."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of ``/roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` or ``/roles/web-app-kix/user`` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. On every sign-in ``GroupDNBasedRoleSync`` sets the KIX roles from the role groups: ``administrator`` grants ``Superuser``, ``user`` grants ``Ticket Agent``, and a role the user no longer holds is revoked."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Per-application timeout:** Every collector is cut off after `SYS_TIMEOUT_CLEANUP_APP`, on the host and inside the container, where a killed `docker exec` client would leave the work running."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Per-application timeout:** Every collector is cut off after ``SYS_TIMEOUT_CLEANUP_APP``, on the host and inside the container, where a killed ``docker exec`` client would leave the work running."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-consumer isolation:** Every consumer receives its own identity and bucket with bucket-scoped actions only."
msgstr "**isoleerimine tarbija kohta:** Iga tarbija saab oma identiteedi ja ämbri ainult kopp-skoopitud toimingutega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-consumer virtual keys:** Each consuming application receives its own virtual key, created through the gateway admin API under an alias naming that application."
msgstr "**Virtuaalsed võtmed tarbija kohta:** Iga tarbiv rakendus saab oma virtuaalse võtme, mis on loodud gateway admin API kaudu selle rakenduse nime all."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-container snapshots:** rsync `--link-dest` snapshots deduplicate unchanged files across runs."
