# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Preloaded models:** Every entry of ``services.lmstudio.preload_models`` is downloaded on the hosting node with ``lms get --gguf``, overlapped and reaped like the Ollama pre-pull. Each entry carries the ``source`` repository to download, the ``quant`` variant to take from it, the ``name`` LM Studio indexes that repository under and the gateway addresses it by, and the ``alias`` the gateway publishes it as. ``source`` is a full Hugging Face URL, never a search term: a search term resolves to whichever model the catalogue lists first. ``quant`` is appended as ``@<variant>`` and is required: without it LM Studio picks the variant itself, and the ``file``, ``sha256`` and ``bytes`` the entry declares then describe a guess that the store check and the download budget are both measured against."
msgstr "**Eellaaditud mudelid:** Iga sissekanne ``services.lmstudio.preload_models`` on alla laaditud hostimissõlme ``lms get --gguf``, kattus ja lõikas nagu Ollama eeltõmbamine. Iga sissekanne kannab ``source`` allalaaditav hoidla, ``quant`` variant, mida sellest võtta, ``name`` LM Studio indekseerib hoidlat, mille all hoidla asub ja mille kaudu digivärav seda käsitleb, ning ``alias`` Värav avaldab selle. ``source`` See on täielik Hugging Face URL, mitte kunagi otsingutermin: otsingutermin lahendab selle, milline mudel kataloogi nimekirjad esimesena. ``quant`` lisatakse ``@<variant>`` ja on nõutav: ilma selleta LM Studio valib variandi ise ja ``file``, ``sha256`` ja ``bytes`` Sissekanne deklareerib seejärel kirjeldama, et poe kontroll ja allalaadimise eelarve on mõlemad mõõdetud."

