msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** on a btrfs data root the whole run is captured from one atomic filesystem snapshot with no container stopped; the host is probed before every run and falls back to the live copy when a snapshot would not be faithful."
msgstr "**Snapshot-ware:** btrfs-i andmejuurel jäädvustatakse kogu jooksu ühest aatomfailisüsteemi hetktõmmisest ilma, et konteiner oleks peatatud; hosti sondeeritakse enne iga jooksu ja see langeb tagasi live-koopiale, kui hetktõmmis ei oleks ustav."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync `--link-dest` against the previous local snapshot deduplicates unchanged files."
msgstr "**Snapshot-ware:** Rsync `--link-dest` võrreldes eelmise kohaliku hetkepildiga deduplikaate muutmata failidega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync `--link-dest` against the previous snapshot keeps storage growth proportional to actual change."
msgstr "**Snapshot-ware:** Rsync `--link-dest` võrreldes eelmise hetkeseisuga hoiab salvestuse kasvu proportsionaalsena tegeliku muutusega."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync ``--link-dest`` against the previous local snapshot deduplicates unchanged files."
