msgid "**``sso``:** ``enable-login-with-oidc`` (the in-app “OpenID” entry to ```web-app-keycloak`` <../web-app-keycloak/>`__) together with ``enable-oidc-registration``, so a first OIDC login creates its Penpot profile while local self-registration stays closed."
