# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`deny`** (precedence 1): structurally destructive shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paths)."
msgstr "**`deny`** (tähtsusjärjekord 1): Struktuurselt hävitavad kujundid on blokeeritud otse, isegi kui liivakasti. Hõlmab kesta silmuseid (`for`/`while`/`until`), ristrepo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privilegeeritud `gh` tegusõnu (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`)ja mutatsiooni `gh api` tegusõnu (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge rajad)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`disable-onboarding`** is in `PENPOT_FLAGS` so users land directly on the dashboard (sovereign install; also keeps the project/asset flows testable)."
msgstr "**`disable-onboarding`** on `PENPOT_FLAGS` nii et kasutajad maanduvad otse armatuurlauale (riiklik installatsioon; hoiab ka projekti/vara vood kontrollitavana)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`docker exec` is FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NEVER invoke `docker exec` (nor nested `docker exec … docker exec …` into the DiD stack) directly. Always reach the live stack through `make` targets (e.g. `make compose-exec`, or the role-specific targets the `Makefile` exposes). If no `make` target covers what you need, ask the operator instead of falling back to raw `docker exec`."
msgstr "**`docker exec` on keelatud. ⛔** Sa ei pea kunagi helistama `docker exec` (pesitsenud `docker exec … docker exec …` DiD virna) otse. Alati jõuda live virna läbi `make` sihtmärgid (nt. `make compose-exec`, või rollispetsiifilised eesmärgid `Makefile` paljastab)Kui ei. `make` Sihtmärk katab, mida vajate, küsige operaatorilt selle asemel, et toorelt tagasi langeda `docker exec`."

