msgid "A handler MAY import stdlib, [parser.py](../parser.py), [runtime.py](../runtime.py), and any repo module whose own import closure is stdlib-only. The whole closure MUST import and run on the bare bootstrap python, before any dependency is installed. `utils.cache.files` and [yaml_bootstrap.py](../../yaml_bootstrap.py) qualify; `utils.cache.yaml` does not, because it imports PyYAML. Read SPOT files with `utils.cache.files.read_text` plus `utils.yaml_bootstrap.load_block` or a stdlib line parse. `load_block` accepts block mappings, block lists and string scalars only, and raises `BootstrapYamlError` on everything else, so a SPOT file read this way MUST stay inside that subset. [test_bare_bootstrap.py](../../../tests/integration/meta/env/test_bare_bootstrap.py) enforces this by running the generator with every non-stdlib import blocked."
msgstr "Käitleja VÕIB importida stdlib’i, [parser.py](../parser.py), [runtime.py](../runtime.py), ja mis tahes repomoodul, mille impordi sulgemine on ainult stadlib. Kogu sulgemine PEAB importima ja töötama paljas bootstrap pythonil, enne kui sõltuvus on paigaldatud. `utils.cache.files` ja [yaml_bootstrap.py](../../yaml_bootstrap.py) kvalifitseeruda; `utils.cache.yaml` Ei ole, sest ta impordib PyYAMLi. SPOT- failide lugemine `utils.cache.files.read_text` pluss `utils.yaml_bootstrap.load_block` või stdlib joone parse. `load_block` aktsepteerib ainult plokkide kaardistamist, plokkide loendeid ja stringide skalaare ning tõstab `BootstrapYamlError` Kõigel muul, nii et SPOT-fail peab jääma sellesse alamhulka. [test_bare_bootstrap.py](../../../tests/integration/meta/env/test_bare_bootstrap.py) jõustab selle, käivitades generaatori iga mittestdlibi impordi blokeerimisega."

