msgid "An addon under `meta/addons/` MAY declare an `incompatible_plugins` list in its `config:`. The plan's `disable` list carries every listed plugin that ends up off and still runs, and [02_install.yml](./02_install.yml) disables the listed plugins again before an install attempt. This guarantees that mutually exclusive integrations such as the OIDC entry points (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) and the document-editing surfaces (`onlyoffice`, `richdocuments`, `fileslibreofficeedit`) cannot accidentally coexist on the same instance."
