msgstr "Tuletatud ca_trust_paths SPOT SOFTWARE_NAME (group_vars); tarbitud ``scripts/system/tls/trust/*.sh`` Nii et tee ei ela kunagi kestasõnades. SOFTWARE_NAME on yaml-laaditud asemel liiniparsed: env-generaator töötab enne sõltuvust paljas bootstrap pythonil (PyyAML) on paigaldatud."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Derived from the host's default-route interface MTU so the compose bridge never exceeds the path MTU (TLS handshakes silently drop fragments otherwise). When no default route is readable (agent sandboxes run in a network namespace whose /proc/net/route is empty, while /sys/class/net still shows the host NICs), falls back to the minimum MTU across UP physical interfaces; only if that finds nothing either does the static default from ``default.env`` apply."
msgstr "Tuletatud hosti vaikimisi marsruudi liidesest MTU, nii et komposiidisild ei ületa kunagi teed MTU (TLS käepigistus vaikib fragmente, muidu). Kui vaikimisi marsruut ei ole loetav (agent liivakastid töötavad võrgu nimeruumis, mille /proc/net/marsruut on tühi, samas kui /sys/class/net näitab endiselt hosti NIC-e), langeb tagasi minimaalsele MTU-le kõigis UP füüsilistes liidestes; ainult siis, kui see ei leia midagi, on staatiline vaikeväärtus ``default.env`` kohaldada."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Derived from the paths SPOT (utils.paths, backed by group_vars/all/05_paths.yml). This uniform layout is what lets a recovery target a host by name alone: every host restores into these same paths."
msgstr "Tuletatud radadest SPOT (utils.paths, mida toetab group_vars/all/05_paths.yml). See ühtlane paigutus võimaldab taastesihtida ainult nimepidi: iga võõrustaja taastub nendesse samadesse radadesse."

msgid "Derives the `--design-*` tokens for light and dark mode from one base color in OKLCH, with WCAG 2.2 contrast checked on the rounded hex value."
msgstr ""

msgid "Derives the handle `<username>.<PDS_HANDLE_DOMAIN>` from the Keycloak username, or `i8-<username>.<PDS_HANDLE_DOMAIN>` when the PDS answers `Reserved handle`. A first label longer than 18 characters cannot be a handle; the broker then shows a form at `/sso/handle` where the user picks one of 3 to 18 characters from `[a-z0-9-]` that contains a hyphen and never contains `i8-`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Deriving the list from every ``image:`` in ``roles/**/meta/services.yml`` keeps it complete by construction: a role that adopts an image from a new registry brings that registry with it. ``BASE`` carries the registries that were configured before this was derived and that no role image names, so turning the list into a derived one cannot silently drop them."
