msgid "Each chunk block shows up as `<keycap> Batch`, from `0️⃣ Batch` to `3️⃣ Batch`, and its discover job as `🔍 Batch <index>`. A batch that holds priority rows wears a trailing `⭐` on both (`0️⃣ Batch ⭐`, `🔍 Batch 0 ⭐`); its deploy rows carry no star of their own. The selection job counts those batches before any of them runs and exposes the count as its `starred` output (`cli.meta.ci.matrix --priority-chunks`); batch `N` is starred while that count exceeds `N`."
