# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "LAM's entry point is not `${APP_BASE_URL}/`. That path answers with a redirect to `/lam/`, whose body is nothing but `<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; URL=templates/login.php\">`. The shared persona helper samples the DOM for a password field the moment its navigation settles, which is on that empty interstitial, and its fallback paths `/login`, `/admin/` and `/admin` all return 404 at the vhost root — so the login form is never reached. CI traces for the SSO-disabled variants confirm the helper issues no form submission at all, and LAM's own access log records no POST."
msgstr "Kangmehhanismide sisenemispunkt ei ole `${APP_BASE_URL}/`. See tee vastab ümbersuunamisega `/lam/`, kelle keha on vaid `<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; URL=templates/login.php\">`. Jagatud persona abimees proovib DOM-i paroolivälja hetkel, mil selle navigeerimine settib, mis on sellel tühjal interstitsiaalsel, ja selle varuteed. `/login`, `/admin/` ja `/admin` naaseb 404 Vhost root - nii sisselogimisvorm ei jõua kunagi. SSO-ga keelatud variantide CI jäljed kinnitavad, et abiline ei esita üldse vormi ning LAM-i enda juurdepääsulogis ei registreerita Posti."

msgid "LAM's search login accepts the platform administrator's user name and `lookup('users', 'platform_administrator').password`, the same pair the shared helper types. [`files/playwright/test-directory-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-directory-login.js) asserts that login, the group filter and the write access directly."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "LAM’s entry point is not ``${APP_BASE_URL}/``. That path answers with a redirect to ``/lam/``, whose body is nothing but ``<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; URL=templates/login.php\">``. The shared persona helper samples the DOM for a password field the moment its navigation settles, which is on that empty interstitial, and its fallback paths ``/login``, ``/admin/`` and ``/admin`` all return 404 at the vhost root — so the login form is never reached. CI traces for the SSO-disabled variants confirm the helper issues no form submission at all, and LAM’s own access log records no POST."
msgstr "Kangmehhanismide sisenemispunkt ei ole ``${APP_BASE_URL}/``. See tee vastab ümbersuunamisega ``/lam/``, kelle keha on vaid ``<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; URL=templates/login.php\">``. Jagatud persona abimees proovib DOM-i paroolivälja hetkel, mil selle navigeerimine settib, mis on sellel tühjal interstitsiaalsel, ja selle varuteed. ``/login``, ``/admin/`` ja ``/admin`` naaseb 404 Vhost root - nii sisselogimisvorm ei jõua kunagi. SSO-puuetega variantide CI jäljed kinnitavad, et abiline ei esita üldse vormi ning LAM-i enda juurdepääsulogis ei registreerita Posti."

msgid "LAM’s search login accepts the platform administrator’s user name and ``lookup('users', 'platform_administrator').password``, the same pair the shared helper types. ```files/playwright/test-directory-login.js`` <./files/playwright/test-directory-login.js>`__ asserts that login, the group filter and the write access directly."
