msgid "On an ephemeral runtime (``deployment.ephemeral``) providers are narrowed to ``application_closure(deployment.whitelist)``, the same set ``sys-service-loader`` preloads from: there inventory membership, ``group_names`` and the raw whitelist all admit roles the run never deploys, and a client would carry an endpoint nothing is serving. A persistent host keeps serving every provider an earlier run deployed, so a partial run there narrows nothing and the client keeps them."
