msgstr "Vahemälu optimeerimine"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux and Debian-based systems, this role ensures the presence of Node.js for use in Node-based applications or scripts. It serves as a foundational role for projects that depend on Node.js runtimes or utilities like Puppeteer."
msgstr "Optimeeritud Archlinux' ja Debiani süsteemide jaoks, tagab see roll Node.js kasutamiseks sõlmepõhistes rakendustes või skriptides. See on aluseks projektidele, mis sõltuvad Node.js Käiguajad või kommunaalteenused nagu Nuppeteer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux environments, this role provides a lightweight, reliable solution for serving static websites. It automatically configures NGINX to serve files from a predefined directory, sets up secure HTTPS connections, and includes support for `.well-known` paths required by ACME challenges."
msgstr "Optimeeritud Archlinux keskkondade jaoks, pakub see roll kerget ja usaldusväärset lahendust staatiliste veebisaitide teenindamiseks. See konfigureerib automaatselt NGINXi failide edastamiseks eelnevalt määratud kataloogist, loob turvalised HTTPS-ühendused ja sisaldab toetust `.well-known` ACME väljakutsetele vastavad teed."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux environments, this role provides a lightweight, reliable solution for serving static websites. It automatically configures NGINX to serve files from a predefined directory, sets up secure HTTPS connections, and includes support for ``.well-known`` paths required by ACME challenges."
msgstr "Optimeeritud Archlinux keskkondade jaoks, pakub see roll kerget ja usaldusväärset lahendust staatiliste veebisaitide teenindamiseks. See konfigureerib automaatselt NGINXi failide edastamiseks eelnevalt määratud kataloogist, loob turvalised HTTPS-ühendused ja sisaldab toetust ``.well-known`` ACME väljakutsetele vastavad teed."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux systems, this role installs the ``certbot-NGINX`` package, configures a dedicated ``systemd`` service for certificate renewal, and integrates with a ``sys-timer`` to schedule periodic renewals. After a renewal, NGINX is reloaded to apply the updated certificates immediately."
msgstr "Optimeeritud Archlinux süsteemidele, see roll paigaldab ``certbot-NGINX`` pakett, seadistab spetsiaalse ``systemd`` sertifikaadi uuendamise teenus ja see integreeritakse ``sys-timer`` perioodiliste uuendamiste ajakava. Pärast uuendamist laaditakse NGINX uuesti uuendatud sertifikaatide koheseks rakendamiseks."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux systems, this role installs the `certbot-NGINX` package, configures a dedicated `systemd` service for certificate renewal, and integrates with a `sys-timer` to schedule periodic renewals. After a renewal, NGINX is reloaded to apply the updated certificates immediately."
msgstr "Optimeeritud Archlinux süsteemidele, see roll paigaldab `certbot-NGINX` pakett, seadistab spetsiaalse `systemd` sertifikaadi uuendamise teenus ja see integreeritakse `sys-timer` perioodiliste uuendamiste ajakava. Pärast uuendamist laaditakse NGINX uuesti uuendatud sertifikaatide koheseks rakendamiseks."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux, this role configures NGINX to act as a lightweight and efficient file server. It ensures that files are served securely, with optional directory browsing enabled, and proper MIME type handling for standard web clients."
msgstr "Archlinuxi jaoks optimeerituna konfigureerib see roll NGINXi toimima kerge ja tõhusa failiserverina. See tagab, et faile teenindatakse turvaliselt, valikuline kataloogi sirvimine on lubatud ja nõuetekohane MIME-tüüpi käitlemine standardsetele veebiklientidele."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux, this role creates the required directory structure, installs and configures the sys-ctl-hlth-check script, and integrates with the **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** role. It uses the **sys-timer** role to schedule regular checks based on your customizable `OnCalendar` setting."
msgstr "Archlinuxi jaoks optimeerituna loob see roll vajaliku kataloogistruktuuri, installib ja konfigureerib sys-ctl-hlth-check skripti ning integreerub **sys-ctl-alm-telegramm** rolli. See kasutab **sys-timer** Regulaarsete kontrollide ajakava vastavalt teie kohandatavale `OnCalendar` seaded."

