msgid "Ownership: registry mirror (`rpardini/docker-registry-proxy:0.6.5`), Nexus 3.91.1 and the nginx frontend are services of the slot-0 checkout's compose project ([cache.override.yml:6-105](../../compose/cache.override.yml), started only by the owner in [compose.py:255-267](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/compose.py)). Worktrees join that project's network through `docker inspect infinito-registry-cache` ([lib.sh:95-99](../../scripts/system/worktree/lib.sh), [up.sh:46,75](../../scripts/system/worktree/up.sh), [cache.shared.override.yml:8-19](../../compose/cache.shared.override.yml)). `make compose-down` in the owning checkout runs `down --remove-orphans -v` over the whole project ([down.py:57-63](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/down.py)), cache services included."
