msgid "Runner iteration routine: change the svc-runner role, gate on make test, deploy to a systemd host, and confirm the registered runner. One model step reads the deploy, the systemd status and the test-e2e-cli output; DinD proves the deploy structurally only. The relevant-delta decision skips a deploy nothing changed for, and a red deploy passes the red chain before the next inspect."
msgstr ""

msgid "Runner pool (Phase 8)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Runner pool: `svc-runner` gets a `local` flavor with no GitHub registration, jobs submitted by make, the worktree mounted instead of checked out, and a hold mode that keeps the job's DinD stack after the deploy for `compose-exec` and `compose-inner-run` iteration until a make target releases it. The infra inventory deploys one runner stack with N runners. Every local test deploy runs as a runner job with its own DinD (unique subnet, names and volume, as `svc-runner` does per CI job). CI deploys use the same job entry script. The pool replaces the per-worktree slot scheme for deploys after a live proof."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Runner topology is a **single all-in-one container** with the embedded runner."
msgstr "Jooksutopoloogia on **üks all-in-one konteiner** varjatud jooksjaga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Runner waves that still start inside the queue window. Floored at 1: a job timeout at or above the window means one wave, never zero."
msgstr "Jooksulained, mis ikka veel algavad järjekorraaknast. Põrandale 1: Tööaeg aknal või selle kohal tähendab ühte lainet, mitte kunagi nulli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Runner 🚀"
msgstr "Jooksja 🚀"

msgid "Runner: [svc-runner](../../roles/svc-runner/README.md) provisions `RUNNER_COUNT` ephemeral GitHub runners (DooD on the host socket). Each CI job gets its own Infinito DinD with a unique compose project, prefix, subnet `172.30.<instance>.0/24` and Docker volume ([runner_instance_env.j2:1-16](../../roles/svc-runner/templates/runner_instance_env.j2)); runners register with a GitHub PAT at start. `RUNNER_COUNT` defaults to CPUs divided by `RUNNER_CPUS` (`defaults/main.yml:5`). Branch `refactor/svc-runner/default-instance-dir` (`f67d80813a`, merged into IAM soon) moves the runner stack to `/opt/compose/runner`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Runners mount the primary checkout and `~/.local/share/worktrees` by default; the roots are overridable."
