# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects `/` to the public `/discover` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control."
msgstr "Taiga suunab ümber `/` avalikkusele `/discover` showcase, mis muudab tühi sisselogimislingi, kuid mitte OIDC sisenemispunkti; ainult `/login` SSO direktiiv on siduv (nooti [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js))Jagatud isikud sisenevad alati saidi juure, nii et nad ei jõua kunagi TaigaSSO nupp. Taiga AngularJS kest paljastab lisaks ka logouti ainult läbi `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` direktiivid, mida üldine rakendusesisene väljalogimise abimees ei saa aktiveerida. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) kuulutab `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; samaväärseid reise juhib kohalik roll `test-login-oidc.js` ja `test-login-native.js` spetsifikatsioonid, mis sisenevad `/login` sisse logida Taigaenesekontroll."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects ``/`` to the public ``/discover`` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only ``/login`` binds the SSO directive (see the note in ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` and log out through Taiga’s own control."
msgstr "Taiga suunab ümber ``/`` avalikkusele ``/discover`` showcase, mis muudab tühi sisselogimislingi, kuid mitte OIDC sisenemispunkti; ainult ``/login`` SSO direktiiv on siduv (nooti ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` sisse logida Taigaoma kontrolli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role handles the installation of Firefox using the system’s package manager (``pacman``). It deploys a ``policies.json`` file to Firefox’s distribution directory, ensuring that critical extensions are automatically installed via Firefox Enterprise Policies."
msgstr "Arch Linuxi jaoks kohandatud, see roll tegeleb Firefox süsteemi paketihalduri kasutamine (``pacman``). See kasutab ``policies.json`` faili Firefox’ jaotuskataloogi, tagades, et kriitilised laiendused paigaldatakse automaatselt Firefox Ettevõtluspoliitika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role handles the installation of Firefox using the system’s package manager (`pacman`). It deploys a `policies.json` file to Firefox’s distribution directory, ensuring that critical extensions are automatically installed via Firefox Enterprise Policies."
msgstr "Arch Linuxi jaoks kohandatud, see roll tegeleb Firefox süsteemi paketihalduri kasutamine (`pacman`). See kasutab `policies.json` faili Firefox’ jaotuskataloogi, tagades, et kriitilised laiendused paigaldatakse automaatselt Firefox Ettevõtluspoliitika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role installs GCC and optionally sets up additional development utilities. It ensures the package is installed via the system package manager and ready to compile code in a variety of programming languages."
msgstr "Arch Linuxi jaoks kohandatud, see roll installib GCC ja valikuliselt loob täiendavaid arendusettevõtteid. See tagab paketi installimise süsteemipaketihalduri kaudu ja valmis koodi kompileerimiseks erinevates programmeerimiskeeltes."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role monitors containers for failure states and initiates a controlled restart of affected Compose configurations. If port conflicts prevent recovery, the role stops the affected stack, restarts Docker, and recreates the container environment."
msgstr "Arch Linuxi jaoks kohandatud roll jälgib konteinereid tõrkeseisundite jaoks ja käivitab mõjutatud Compose'i konfiguratsioonide kontrollitud taaskäivitamise. Kui sadamakonfliktid takistavad taastamist, peatab roll mõjutatud virna, taaskäivitab Dockeri ja taastab konteinerikeskkonna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for creative professionals and developers, this role streamlines the process of setting up a portfolio site. It automates tasks such as Docker container configuration, dynamic routing via NGINX, and repository integration, so you can concentrate on perfecting your content and design. Enjoy a responsive layout and easy-to-modify YAML files that let you rapidly update your online presence without deep technical intervention."
msgstr "Loomingulistele spetsialistidele ja arendajatele kohandatud roll lihtsustab portfelli loomise protsessi. See automatiseerib selliseid ülesandeid nagu Dockeri konteineri konfiguratsioon, dünaamiline marsruutimine NGINXi kaudu ja hoidla integreerimine, et saaksite keskenduda oma sisu ja disaini täiustamisele. Nautige tundlikku paigutust ja hõlpsasti muudetavaid YAML-faile, mis võimaldavad teil oma online-kohalolekut kiiresti värskendada ilma sügava tehnilise sekkumiseta."

