# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Ansible module / task usage rules."
msgstr "Selle kataloogi testid PEAVAD hõlmama ainult ansible mooduli / ülesande kasutamise reegleid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover CLI-level behavior (argument parsing, `--help`, dispatcher). Tests for the libraries that CLIs import MUST live under `tests/unit/` or the relevant topical cluster."
msgstr "Testid selles kataloogis PEAB hõlmama ainult CLI-taseme käitumist (argumentide parsimine, `--help`, dispetšer). Katsed teekidele, mida CLI-d impordivad, PEAVAD elama allpool `tests/unit/` või asjakohane aktuaalne klaster."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Docker-specific semantics (images, tags, compose-service configuration). Generic compose-structure rules MUST live under `tests/integration/compose/`, and backup-related checks MUST live under `tests/integration/backups/`."
msgstr "Testid selles kataloogis PEAB hõlmama ainult Dockeri-spetsiifilist semantikat (pildid, sildid, komponeerimisteenuse konfiguratsioon). Üldised komposiitstruktuuri reeglid PEAVAD elama `tests/integration/compose/`, ja varundamisega seotud kontrollid PEVAD elama `tests/integration/backups/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover GitHub-side CI/CD artefacts (workflows, Dependabot, PR helpers). Tests for local `make` targets, role logic, or non-CI scripts MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Selles kataloogis PEAVAD testid hõlmama ainult GitHubi-poolseid CI/CD artefakte (Töövood, Dependabot, PR-abilised). Kohalikud testid `make` Sihtmärgid, rolliloogika või mitte-CI skriptid PEAVAD elama mujal `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Jinja-level concerns (template parsing, `{% include %}` resolution, variable reference/definition symmetry). Filter-plugin tests MUST live under `tests/integration/filters/`."
msgstr "Testid selles kataloogis PEAB katma ainult Jinja taseme probleeme (mallide parsimine, `{% include %}` eraldusvõime, muutuv etalon-/määratlussümmeetria). Filtriplugina testid PEVAD elama allpool `tests/integration/filters/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Jinja2 expression composition rules. Rules that validate where dotted-path targets are declared live in the sibling [`../variables/`](../variables/) directory."
msgstr "Testid selles kataloogis PEAB katma ainult Jinja2 avaldise koostise reeglid. Reeglid, mis kinnitavad, kus punktiirjoone sihtmärgid on õe-venna elus deklareeritud [`../variables/`](../variables/) kataloogi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Playwright env-template / spec parity. The dashboard-scope sub-rule MUST live under [`dashboard/`](../dashboard/)."
msgstr "Selle kataloogi testid PEVAD hõlmama ainult Playwrighti env-template / spec parity't. Armatuurlaua-alamreeglit PEAB elama [`dashboard/`](../dashboard/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Python source patterns. Dependency declarations MUST live under [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); YAML/Jinja patterns MUST live under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."
msgstr "Selles kataloogis olevad testid PEVAD katma ainult Pythoni lähtemustreid. Sõltuvusdeklaratsioonid PEAVAD elama [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); YAML/Jinja mustrid peavad elama allpool [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover SQL-shape rules inside Ansible tasks."
msgstr "Selles kataloogis olevad testid PEVAD katma ainult SQL-kujulisi reegleid Ansible ülesannete sees."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover SSO configuration invariants. Generic port-uniqueness and port-reference-validity rules MUST live under `tests/integration/ports/`, and domain-related checks MUST live under `tests/integration/domains/`."
msgstr "Selle kataloogi testid PEAVAD hõlmama ainult SSO konfiguratsiooni invariante. Sadama kordumatuse ja võrdluskehtivuse üldeeskirjad PEAVAD vastama `tests/integration/ports/`, ja domeenidega seotud kontrollid PEAVAD elama `tests/integration/domains/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `.sh` source patterns. Python rules MUST live under [`python/`](../python/); YAML/Jinja rules MUST live under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."
msgstr "Testid selles kataloogis PEAB ainult katma `.sh` allikamustrid. Pythoni reeglid peavad elama allpool [`python/`](../python/); YAML/Jinja reeglid peavad elama [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` content patterns. Python source rules MUST live under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."
msgstr "Testid selles kataloogis PEAB ainult katma `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` sisumustrid. Pythoni allika reeglid peavad elama all [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `08_networks.yml` consistency and its coupling to roles. Tests for port allocations MUST live under `tests/integration/ports/`, and domain-related checks MUST live under `tests/integration/domains/`."
msgstr "Testid selles kataloogis PEAB ainult katma `08_networks.yml` järjepidevus ja selle seos rollidega. Sadamate jaotamise testid PEAVAD elama allpool `tests/integration/ports/`, ja domeenidega seotud kontrollid PEAVAD elama `tests/integration/domains/`."

