msgstr "AT protokolli PDS, OAuthi identiteet ja sisselogimisvahendaja külgkorv. Atmo \"kirjutage Bluesky\" punktid. Mitut üksust hõlmav `services.yml` (pds/web/view/broker/api) on mall atmo appview + worker-runtime spliti jaoks."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The AT→AP direction has a clean trigger (firehose) and a clean sink (GraphQL). The reverse direction needs an AT identity to write records as, which is unresolved."
msgstr "AT→AP suunal on puhas päästik (tuletõrjevoolik) ja puhta kraanikausi (GraphQL). Pöördsuund vajab kirjete kirjutamiseks AT-identiteeti, mis on lahendamata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The AUR PKGBUILDs this project consumes carry a checksum on a git source, which makepkg can only reject; integrity rests on the pinned upstream tag fetched over HTTPS."
msgstr "AUR PKGBUILD-id, mida see projekt tarbib, kannavad git-allikal kontrollsummat, mida makepkg saab ainult tagasi lükata; terviklikkus toetub HTTPS-i kaudu tõmmatud kinnitatud ülesvoolu sildile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The AUR is one origin host with no mirror pool behind it, so a flap there lasts minutes rather than the seconds a pool member needs to rotate out; EXTERNAL_FETCH's ~40s window has been observed losing to a single flap."
msgstr "AUR on üks päritolu host, mille taga ei ole peegli basseini, nii et klapp kestab minutid, mitte sekundid, mida basseini liige peab pöörlema; EXTERNAL_FETCH's ~40On täheldatud, et aken kaotab ühe klapi."

msgid "The Actions Worker dies silently on ENOSPC while writing its own logs, so a full disk truncates the job without diagnostics; terminating the step at DISK_FLOOR_MB keeps enough room for rescue artifacts and the log upload. A stuck mount produces the same silence without touching either floor, so IO_STALL_CEILING_PCT ends the step while the runner can still upload. It takes three things together, because the pressure reading alone cannot tell a wedge from a busy disk and is not even this step's: a task in D state on the same sample, WEDGE_SAMPLES breaches in a row, and a step old enough to own a whole STALL_WINDOW_S of the trailing average. Without the last one an I/O-heavy predecessor aborts its successor before that step has issued a single read."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Actions worker writes its own diagnostics log to `/`. When `/` runs full the worker dies, the job log is lost and no `always()` step runs ([#1377](https://github.com/infinito-nexus/core/issues/1377)). The image build therefore runs under [disk/guard.sh](../../../../../scripts/github/runner/disk/guard.sh):"
msgstr ""

