msgid "The `administrator` persona is **not** blocked: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The `biber` persona is blocked in every variant: biber holds no OpenProject role, so the oauth2-proxy gate and the LDAP `filter_string` refuse it. [test-rbac-gate.js](./files/playwright/test-rbac-gate.js) asserts that refusal, then adds biber to the `user` role group and drives the sign-in through the trusted-header bridge. Both flags are declared explicitly in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)."
