# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The list was held against the repository by three lints that parsed this section. They are gone, and the trade is deliberate: a lint that reads prose ties every role addition to an edit here, and the audit is a review record rather than a runtime registry. What they proved while they ran is worth keeping: the classification check named twenty-four roles whose audit entry contradicted their own metadata the first time it ran, nine of them shipping an adapter while the list still called them untried candidates. Without them, a role added later is absent here until someone notices."
msgstr "Nimekirja hoidsid hoidla vastu kolm litti, mis parsisid selle osa. Nad on läinud ja kauplemine on tahtlik: lint, mis loeb proosasidemeid iga rolli lisaks redigeerimisele siin, ja audit on pigem ülevaatusprotokoll kui jooksva aja register. See, mida nad jooksid, on väärt hoidmist: klassifitseerimiskontroll nimetas kakskümmend neli rolli, mille auditi sissekanne oli vastuolus nende enda metaandmetega esimest korda, üheksa neist saatis adapteri, samas kui nimekiri nimetas neid veel katsetamata kandidaatideks. Ilma nendeta puudub siin hiljem lisatud roll, kuni keegi märkab."

