# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The published (host) port is ``ports.local.<proto>`` when declared, else ``ports.public.<proto>``; the container port is ``ports.internal.<proto>``."
msgstr "Avaldatud (võõrustaja) sadam ``ports.local.<proto>`` deklareerimise korral, muul juhul ``ports.public.<proto>``; konteinerisadam on ``ports.internal.<proto>``."

