msgstr "Tagastatud token nimetab koha edetabelis, nii et see ei kanna kirveid ega ka selle taga olev liikmesuse test. (:func:`proven_rows`): lähtekood registreeris oma kombinatsioonid oma pühkimisnumbri all ja retrigger saab uue, nii et nende võrdlemine rea kaupa on ainus võrdlus, mis rotatsiooni üle elab."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reusable generator logic lives in `utils/domains/list.py`"
msgstr "Taaskasutatava generaatori loogika elab `utils/domains/list.py`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reverse closure is fail-safe: any seed that is not modellable in the resolver (no `application_id` and not referenced by any role's `run_after`) MUST trigger a fall-back to a full deploy, as MUST any resolver runtime error. The closure MUST NOT silently shrink the deploy matrix on partial information. The variant narrowing follows the same rule: a role reached only through a `run_after` edge (which the round closure does not follow) keeps every variant, and so does a seed role itself, whose own files changed."
msgstr "Tagurpidi sulgur on tõrkekindel: mis tahes seeme, mis ei ole lahendajas modelleeritav (ei `application_id` ja ei viita ühelegi rollile `run_after`) PEAVAD käivitama varuvariandi täielikule kasutuselevõtule, kuna PEAB olema mis tahes lahendusaja viga. Sulgemine EI TOHI vaikides kahandada sisendmaatriksit osalise informatsiooni korral. Variant kitsendamine järgib sama reeglit: roll saavutatakse ainult läbi `run_after` serva (millele ei järgne vooru sulgemist) Hoiab iga varianti ja ka seemneroll ise, kelle enda failid muutusid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The reverse closure is implemented in [affected resolver](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/affected/__main__.py) and invoked from [affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh). The workflow glue lives in [effective_whitelist.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh)."
msgstr "Tagurpidi sulgemine toimub [mõjutatud lahendaja](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/affected/__main__.py) ja tuginesid [affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh). Töövooliim elab [effective_whitelist.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh)."

