# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST follow the standard role-meta layout described in [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) (`meta/services.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/variants.yml`, `meta/info.yml`, `meta/main.yml`). [web-app-openproject](../../roles/web-app-openproject/) is the closest structural model — it combines PostgreSQL, a Redis `cache` service, background workers, an internal proxy, Keycloak SSO and LDAP — and SHOULD be used as the primary reference; [web-app-taiga](../../roles/web-app-taiga/) and [web-app-confluence](../../roles/web-app-confluence/) are secondary references."
msgstr "Roll PEAB järgima standardset rollimeta paigutust, mida on kirjeldatud [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) (`meta/services.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/variants.yml`, `meta/info.yml`, `meta/main.yml`). [web-app-openproject](../../roles/web-app-openproject/) See on lähim struktuurne mudel - see ühendab PostgreSQL, Redis `cache` talitus, taustatöötajad, asutusesisene esindaja, Keycloak SSO ja LDAP – ja PEAKS olema esmaseks võrdlusaluseks; [web-app-taiga](../../roles/web-app-taiga/) ja [web-app-confluence](../../roles/web-app-confluence/) on teisesed viited."

