msgid "The target starts from the **distribution base image** `INFINITO_PARENT_IMAGE`, not from an image this project publishes, so the replay also exercises the installation. It carries no container engine of its own: the replayed deploy installs `docker-ce` and restarts `docker.service`, and a target that already ran the distribution's engine fails that restart with `failed to load listeners: no sockets found via socket activation`. Its `/var/lib/docker` is a volume, so the installed daemon lands on a real filesystem."
