# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (``svc-db-postgres``). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, ``shared: false``) or from this central pinned stack (``shared: true``)."
msgstr "Ansible' i roll Memcached tsentraalse mootorisõltuvusena, peegeldades keskandmebaasi mustrit (``svc-db-postgres``). Tarbija jõuab selleni kas (külgkorv oma korstna sees, ``shared: false``) või sellest tsentraalsest nööbitud virnast (``shared: true``)."

