# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a self-hosted Bluesky stack on Docker Compose. It runs the official PDS container as the user-data layer, builds the upstream `@bluesky-social/social-app` web client as the user-facing UI, and adds an in-role login-broker sidecar that gates the web client through Keycloak via `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar. The broker auto-provisions PDS accounts for incoming OIDC users, holds the synthesised app-password AES-256-GCM-encrypted in a process-local cache, and drops a usable PDS session into the social-app's local storage so end users never see the synthesised credential."
msgstr "See roll kasutab enda võõrustajat Bluesky virna Docker ComposeSee käivitab ametliku PDS-konteineri kasutaja-andmete kihina, ehitab ülesvoolu `@bluesky-social/social-app` veebiklient kui kasutajale suunatud kasutajaliides ja lisab rollisisese sisselogimisvahendaja külgkorvi, mis lukustab veebikliendi läbi Keycloak viadu `web-app-keycloak`SSO-proxy külgkorv. Maakleri automaatsed sätted PDS kontod sissetulevatele OIDC kasutajatele, omab sünteesitud rakenduse parooli AES-256GCM-krüptitud protsessi-kohalikus vahemälus ja kukutab kasutatava PDS-seansi sotsiaalse rakenduse kohalikku salvestusse, nii et lõppkasutajad ei näe kunagi sünteesitud mandaati."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a self-hosted Bluesky stack on Docker Compose. It runs the official PDS container as the user-data layer, builds the upstream ``@bluesky-social/social-app`` web client as the user-facing UI, and adds an in-role login-broker sidecar that gates the web client through Keycloak via ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar. The broker auto-provisions PDS accounts for incoming OIDC users, holds the synthesised app-password AES-256-GCM-encrypted in a process-local cache, and drops a usable PDS session into the social-app’s local storage so end users never see the synthesised credential."
