msgstr "See roll vabastab kettaruumi, käivitades skripti, mis puhastab ajutisi faile, puhastab paketi vahemälusid ja puhastab valikuliselt varunduskatalooge ja Dockeri ressursse, kui ketta kasutamine ületab määratud künnise."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role front bootstrap for web apps: HTTPS base, optional Cloudflare setup, and handler wiring."
msgstr "See roll esikäivitus veebirakendustele: HTTPS-baas, valikuline Cloudflare seadistamine ja juhtmestik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role generic role to manage reverse DNS (PTR) for Hetzner Cloud resources (server, primary_ip, floating_ip, load_balancer)."
msgstr "See roll üldine roll pöörd- DNS- i haldamiseks (PTR) Hetzneri pilveressursside jaoks (server, primary_ip, floating_ip, load_balancer)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the ``nftables.service`` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "See roll annab igale teisele rollile ühe koha pakettfiltri reeglite panemiseks. Roll, mis vajab kirjutamist ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` deklareerib oma nftables tabeli ja sisaldab seda rolli; fragment teisendatakse ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, kontrollitud, laaditud ja tagasi loetud, nii et juurutamine ebaõnnestub, mitte ei jäta vaikselt tühikut. Omal jõul paigaldab roll nftables'e, igat fragmenti koormava reeglistiku ja ``nftables.service`` See kordab neid saapas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes `templates/nftables.conf.j2` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the `nftables.service` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "See roll annab igale teisele rollile ühe koha pakettfiltri reeglite panemiseks. Roll, mis vajab kirjutamist `templates/nftables.conf.j2` deklareerib oma nftables tabeli ja sisaldab seda rolli; fragment teisendatakse `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, kontrollitud, laaditud ja tagasi loetud, nii et juurutamine ebaõnnestub, mitte ei jäta vaikselt tühikut. Omal jõul paigaldab roll nftables'e, igat fragmenti koormava reeglistiku ja `nftables.service` See kordab neid saapas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role guarantees the workstation account before any desktop role writes for it."
msgstr "See roll tagab tööjaama konto enne, kui iga töölaua roll sellele kirjutab."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role health-check for Btrfs filesystems, alerts on any device error counters."
msgstr "See roll tervisekontroll Btrfsi failisüsteemidele, hoiatused seadme vealoenduritele."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects Matomo analytics tracking code and noscript image tracker into Nginx-served HTML pages."
msgstr "See roll süstib Matomo analüütiline jälgimiskood ja noscripti pildijälgija Nginx-served HTML-lehekülgedele."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a JS snippet into HTML to notify parent windows of iframe location changes and force external links to new tabs."
msgstr "See funktsioon süstib JS-jupi HTML- i, et teavitada vanemaaknaid iframe'i asukoha muutustest ja sundida väliseid linke uutele kaartidele."

