# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumed by ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no ``meta/addons/`` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, declare them through the unified addon contract under ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "See funktsioon on üldine GNOME laienduse paigaldaja, mida juhib ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, 3- Topeltnimekiri (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) tarbitud ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. Ta ei saada konkreetseid laiendusi oma ja loeb ei ``meta/addons/`` failid. Rollid, mis tarnivad betooni laiendusi, näiteks `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, deklareerida need ühtlustatud lisalepingu alusel ``meta/addons/`` (nõue 026), ühe failiga laienduse kohta (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); vaata seda rolli faili näitel."

