# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Ülesvoolu ``host:port``: komponeerida ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; sülem ``<entity>:<internal>`` (ühiskatte varjunimi) rakenduse kasutajaliidese jaoks või ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` külgkorvidele (sso-proksi). ``host_gateway`` rakendus käivitab sülemi all sõlme-locali ja avaldab oma kohaliku sadama hostile, nii et ülekattega puhverserver jõuab selleni ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` hostvärava kaudu (helistaja lülitab selle välja DEPLOYMENT_MODE, kuna sellised rakendused sunnivad komponeeritud stiilis renderdama)Kadunud parv sisemine sadam."

