msgid "You MUST have a **classic Personal Access Token (PAT)** with the `delete:packages` scope. The `gh auth token` and `GITHUB_TOKEN` issued by GitHub Actions do NOT include this scope and will fail with HTTP 403."
msgstr "Sul peab olema **Klassikaline isikliku juurdepääsu luba (PAT)** koos `delete:packages` ulatus. Theo `gh auth token` ja `GITHUB_TOKEN` Välja antud GitHub Actions EI sisalda seda ulatust ja ei õnnestu HTTP-ga 403."

