# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) is a free, open-source media server. This role deploys the official `jellyfin/jellyfin` container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy, with Keycloak OIDC (web) and central LDAP authentication provisioned via the Jellyfin auth plugins."
msgstr "[Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) See on tasuta, avatud lähtekoodiga meediumiserver. See roll kasutab ametnikku `jellyfin/jellyfin` konteineri taga Infinito.Nexus pöördproksi, Keycloak OIDC (veebi) tsentraalne LDAP-autentimine, mis toimub Jellyfin Auth pluginad."

