msgid "[x] **No `ask` prompts mid-run.** The agent MUST NOT trigger any tool call that routes through `permissions.ask` in [.claude/settings.json](../../.claude/settings.json) during implementation. Where a tool would otherwise route through `ask`, the agent MUST select an equivalent covered by `permissions.allow`, or rephrase the operation to fit the sandbox. The single permitted exception is the final commit."
