# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProviderConnection` is the JSON object `{url, endpoint, model, secret}` built from `MEDIAWIKI_LITELLM_CONNECTION`; `url` is `LITELLM_OPENAI_BASE_LOCAL_URL` and `secret` is this role's own `credentials.litellm_api_key`. The braces are mandatory: a brace-free value is re-wrapped as `{\"legacy\": ...}` upstream and the provider falls back to the vendor endpoint at `api.openai.com`."
msgstr "`$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProviderConnection` on JSON objekt `{url, endpoint, model, secret}` ehitatud `MEDIAWIKI_LITELLM_CONNECTION`; `url` on `LITELLM_OPENAI_BASE_LOCAL_URL` ja `secret` on see roll `credentials.litellm_api_key`. Tahvlid on kohustuslikud: traksideta väärtus mähkitakse ümber nagu `{\"legacy\": ...}` ülesvoolu ja teenusepakkuja pöördub tagasi müüja lõpp-punkti `api.openai.com`."

