msgid "`REGISTRATION_OPEN` and `ALLOW_INVITE_REQUESTS` in `templates/env.j2` have no effect: BookWyrm v0.9.3 reads neither key (absent from `bookwyrm/settings.py`); registration and invite requests live in `SiteSettings.allow_registration` and `SiteSettings.allow_invite_requests` (the landing page shows the invite request form because the latter defaults to true). Options: drop both keys and the `registration_open`/`allow_invite_request` config, or converge the two `SiteSettings` fields in `files/python/site_design.py`."
