msgid "`ansible.builtin.package` ships as a documentation-only stub; its logic lives in Ansible's action plugin. The action plugin here executes modules directly, so it must swap this marker for the host's `ansible_facts.pkg_mgr`."
msgstr "`ansible.builtin.package` Laevad on ainult dokumentatsiooniga stub; selle loogika elab Ansible'i tegevuspluginas. Siin käivitab toiminguplugin moodulid otse, nii et see peab selle markeri masina jaoks vahetama `ansible_facts.pkg_mgr`."

