msgid "`meta/csp.yml` keeps `script-src-elem unsafe-inline` for an inline theme script the 2026.10.8 shell no longer has (it loads `assets/theme-boot.js`; measured: the served `/feed` carries no inline script of its own). Options: drop the flag after checking `hlth-csp`; the injected design script then needs its CSP hash, which `sys-front-inj-design` adds."
