msgid "`sso`: the Keycloak OAuth source (`tasks/setup/oidc.yml`, removed by `tasks/cleanup/oidc.yml` when off). With it on, `[oauth2_client] ENABLE_AUTO_REGISTRATION=true` creates the Gitea account at the first sign-in and `ACCOUNT_LINKING=auto` links a Keycloak identity to the existing account of the same username, so directory accounts synced by the LDAP source and the platform administrator sign in through Keycloak without a link page."
