msgid "`tasks/utils/` is the repository's home for unnumbered, includable task files, so the entrypoint carries no step number."
msgstr "`tasks/utils/` on hoidla koduks lugematutele, kaasamata ülesannete failidele, nii et sisendpunktil ei ole astme numbrit."

