# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`transport` accepts `streamable_http` and `sse` only. A stdio MCP server is a local process the client spawns, so it inherits the client container's filesystem and network with no endpoint to authenticate, no proxy to route through, and nothing for a probe to reach. Every property the other rules rely on (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) is undefined for it. Clients that support stdio are pinned away from it in their own role: Flowise sets `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` so no flow can spawn a command."
msgstr "`transport` aktsepteerib `streamable_http` ja `sse` ainult. Stdio MCP server on lokaalne protsess, mida klient kudeb, nii et see pärib kliendi konteineri failisüsteemi ja võrgu, millel ei ole lõpp-punkti, mida autentida, ei ole puhverserverit, mida läbida, ja midagi, et sondi jõuda. Iga vara, millele teised reeglid tuginevad (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) on selle jaoks määratlemata. Stdiot toetavad kliendid on sellest oma rollis eemal: Flowise komplektid `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` nii et ükski vool ei saa käsku tekitada."

